  "note": "Election of the Newcastle Urban Council, poll due 15 May 1939; the nomination report records no contest (Belfast News-Letter, 6 May 1939, p. 9). R. Hastings, J.P., W. C. M'Cracken and James Gould did not seek re-election. All those nominated were members of the former council. Returned unopposed."
